msgstr "[Mit bosonischen Circuits arbeiten](circuit#bosonic-circuit-explanation) platziert einen Operator als [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\")-Gate in einem Circuit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Simulate Bose-Hubbard dynamics with a choice of encoding](bose-hubbard#bose-hubbard-getting-started) builds the Hamiltonian of a Bose-Hubbard chain and simulates it end to end.\n"
msgstr "[Bose-Hubbard-Dynamik mit wählbarer Kodierung simulieren](bose-hubbard#bose-hubbard-getting-started) baut den Hamiltonoperator einer Bose-Hubbard-Kette und simuliert sie von Anfang bis Ende.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [`qiskit_bosons.operators`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/operators#module-qiskit_bosons.operators \"qiskit_bosons.operators\") and [`qiskit_bosons.operators.terms`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/operators-terms#module-qiskit_bosons.operators.terms \"qiskit_bosons.operators.terms\") modules document the complete interface.\n"
msgstr "Die Module [`qiskit_bosons.operators`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/operators#module-qiskit_bosons.operators \"qiskit_bosons.operators\") und [`qiskit_bosons.operators.terms`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/operators-terms#module-qiskit_bosons.operators.terms \"qiskit_bosons.operators.terms\") dokumentieren die vollständige Schnittstelle.\n"
